        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. ISOGRAM.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01 WS-PHRASE PIC X(60).
        01 WS-RESULT PIC 99.
        01 WS-IDX PIC 9(3).
        01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(3).
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        ISOGRAM.
          MOVE FUNCTION LOWER-CASE(WS-PHRASE) to WS-PHRASE
          MOVE 1 TO WS-RESULT
          PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 by 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > 60
          IF WS-PHRASE(WS-IDX:1) <> " " AND WS-PHRASE(WS-IDX:1) <> "-" 
            MOVE 0 to WS-COUNT
            INSPECT WS-PHRASE TALLYING  WS-COUNT FOR ALL WS-PHRASE(WS-IDX:1)
               IF WS-COUNT > 1
                  MOVE 0 to WS-RESULT
                  EXIT PERFORM
          END-PERFORM.
